--- !u!114 &89498060
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 89498058}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 27be81e0366253c4895cad81c977e3af, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  portuguese: "<b>FASE DO CORTADOR</b>\n\u2022 Setas ou WASD: vira o cortador (ele anda sozinho).\n\u2022 Bateu na cerca? Ele para at\xE9 voc\xEA apertar uma dire\xE7\xE3o.\n\n<b>FASE DO CHEF\xC3O</b>\n\u2022 Setas ou WASD: anda em 8 dire\xE7\xF5es.\n\u2022 Bot\xE3o <b>direito</b> do mouse: lan\xE7a uma folha pontiaguda (gasta muni\xE7\xE3o de folha).\n\u2022 Bot\xE3o <b>esquerdo</b> do mouse: bomba de formiga, cai onde voc\xEA clicou (gasta muni\xE7\xE3o especial).\n\n<b>GERAL</b>\n\u2022 Cada fase dura 30 s e as duas se alternam. Derrube o G.R. Asshole para avan\xE7ar!\n\u2022 ESC fecha esta janela."
  english: "<b>MOWER PHASE</b>\n\u2022 Arrows or WASD: turn the mower (it moves by itself).\n\u2022 Hit the fence? It stops until you press a direction.\n\n<b>BOSS PHASE</b>\n\u2022 Arrows or WASD: move in 8 directions.\n\u2022 <b>Right</b> mouse button: throw a pointed leaf (uses leaf ammo).\n\u2022 <b>Left</b> mouse button: ant bomb, lands where you clicked (uses special ammo).\n\n<b>GENERAL</b>\n\u2022 Each phase lasts 30 s and the two alternate. Take down G.R. Asshole to advance!\n\u2022 ESC closes this window."
--- !u!114 &89498061
