--- !u!114 &783764855
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 783764852}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 27be81e0366253c4895cad81c977e3af, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  portuguese: "O dia est\xE1 ensolarado e, depois de uma \xE1rdua manh\xE3 de trabalho, voc\xEA pode comemorar: abrir uma cerveja (agora Zero) e dar um tibum na piscina.\n\nDaqui a pouco \xE9 hora de arrumar a casa e dar o brilho final l\xE1 dentro."
  english: 'The day is sunny and, after a hard morning of work, you can celebrate: open a beer (Zero now) and take a dip in the pool.


    Soon it will be time to tidy up and give the inside of the house its final shine.'
